117	/* GPIO Pin Definitions for Milk-V Duos Camera Interface
118	 * According to schematic:
119	 *   - XGPIOC17: Sensor RESET (active low)
120	 *   - XGPIOC13: Sensor MCLK output (24MHz)
121	 */
